ice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11405","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c848","characterName":"仲神 かすが","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c848"},"originalCharacterName":"仲神 かすが","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Akihito’s non-blood-related sister. She’s extremely intelligent and talented in music. So much so that she went to Vienne to study music. She moves along her own pace, which is practically as fast as a bullet train. Energetic and crazy 24/7. Cheerful and naive, she doesn’t seem to understand the meaning of restrictions. She likes Akihito which to her equals to marrying Akihito."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Accany's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c848"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4fb5575e3f4761ba701a8ec0ecbb69b7a0ded4ee150c041078dea3d40b253d58.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/dd9fb04d1d14a3c82ddb193071ad36a1dce415f434382630771bf001bdd2e431.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐本 二厘","creatorId":"vndb:s794","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s794","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s794","name":"結下 みちる","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11411","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c849","characterName":"湊 深美","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c849"},"originalCharacterName":"湊 深美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Childhood friend of Akihito, Mimi is also a pretty serious character who’s quiet and calm. Most of the time. As she sticks to Akihito quite a lot, everyone thought that they’re dating, but Mimi is pretty shy so it’s not true."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Accany's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c849"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/26e2f26434ef9ff4066a8211b7bdf12e1237101b30f7eb3b344b4becd6ab5983.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b82cdf4957d9354dabcb56429d465008bfd06ae12e1de96d8f6408196d29ff26.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木村 あやか","creatorId":"vndb:s590","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s590","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s590","name":"いのくち ゆか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11410","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c850","characterName":"代田 憧子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c850"},"originalCharacterName":"代田 憧子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Akihito’s classmate. Very strong for a girl and everyone seems to think she’s the gangster type. A pretty straightforward girl in terms of personality, which is why she’s misunderstood sometimes. Likes girly stuff and has a mischievous personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"edited from Accany's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c850"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/86/86dd4fa2a7870aff37fbee6e9c6dc397a2c2655ceca1a67da76d9198383a21b1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https: